- No, no, I hope you're not offended.
- No, I should have called you.


01:08:40.883 --> 01:08:42.714
- You understand, right?
- Yeah.


01:08:44.887 --> 01:08:47.549
- Great. Okay.
- All right, cool.


01:08:47.656 --> 01:08:50.284
- Great.
- All right, so, yeah.


01:08:50.392 --> 01:08:51.825
- Okay.
- You look good.


01:08:51.927 --> 01:08:53.326
Thank you for that.


01:08:58.067 --> 01:08:59.227
Damn it.


01:09:19.788 --> 01:09:22.757
- So, your dad went to go get dinner?
- Yes.


01:09:24.693 --> 01:09:26.718
Is it... Is it far?


01:09:29.565 --> 01:09:30.691
Maybe.


01:09:33.636 --> 01:09:37.697
- So, you have to be...
- Don't come up in here like you know us.


01:09:38.474 --> 01:09:39.805
Oh, goodness.


01:09:41.110 --> 01:09:44.443
I'm Lauryn and these are my sisters,
Sierra and China.


01:09:46.115 --> 01:09:48.242
- Where did you meet my daddy at?
- We met at work.


01:09:48.350 --> 01:09:52.411
I think you guys saw me in court
the other day. Remember?


01:09:52.521 --> 01:09:55.615
- Oh, court? That was you?
- Yeah.


01:09:55.724 --> 01:09:57.749
You look so much older.


01:10:01.197 --> 01:10:04.633
- What did you say your name was again?
- Julia.


01:10:05.434 --> 01:10:08.494
- Ain't that a white-girl name?
- Okay, now, we're supposed to be nice...


01:10:08.604 --> 01:10:09.696
China.


01:10:09.805 --> 01:10:12.535
...and say thank you for helping my daddy
try to get custody of us.


01:10:12.641 --> 01:10:14.199
Oh, it's no problem, really.


01:10:14.310 --> 01:10:16.642
Well, you could try a little harder.


01:10:16.745 --> 01:10:19.179
I've been having migraines
since I've been living there.


01:10:19.281 --> 01:10:20.748
- Migraines?
- Bad migraines.


01:10:20.849 --> 01:10:22.680
- I'm sorry. I'm trying.
- Really bad migraines.


01:10:22.785 --> 01:10:24.150
- Hey.
- Hey, you made it.


01:10:24.253 --> 01:10:25.982
- Yeah.
- Hey, Daddy.


01:10:28.657 --> 01:10:30.955
Yeah, your kids
are certainly gonna be lawyers


01:10:31.093 --> 01:10:33.084
'cause they sure as heck
grilled the hell out of me.


01:10:33.195 --> 01:10:34.992
I bet they did.


01:10:35.097 --> 01:10:37.827
- Hi, girls. What you doing?
- Nothing.


01:10:40.836 --> 01:10:44.067
And she's at school,
but she is not a nice girl at all.


01:10:44.173 --> 01:10:45.504
- No?
- No.


01:10:45.608 --> 01:10:48.008
- Are you a nice lady?
- I try to be.


01:10:49.211 --> 01:10:51.736
I like your hair. Don't you, Sisi?


01:10:53.148 --> 01:10:54.445
It's all right.


01:10:54.917 --> 01:10:56.748
Looks like a weave to me.


01:10:57.720 --> 01:10:59.119
- No, it's not.
- Sierra.


01:10:59.221 --> 01:11:00.950
- What?
- So rude.


01:11:01.056 --> 01:11:03.081
She's so rude. Are you okay, Daddy?


01:11:03.192 --> 01:11:05.683
- I think it's time for y'all to go to bed.
- No, please.


01:11:05.794 --> 01:11:08.058
- Not yet.
- Just five more minutes, not yet.


01:11:08.163 --> 01:11:09.357
- Good night.
- No.


01:11:09.465 --> 01:11:11.558
- Please, I want to talk to Ms. Julia.
- Say good night.


01:11:11.667 --> 01:11:13.328
- Good night, Ms. Julia.
- Thank you.


01:11:13.435 --> 01:11:15.062
Good night.


01:11:15.170 --> 01:11:17.229
- Good night.
- Sierra.


01:11:19.241 --> 01:11:20.265
Bye.


01:11:21.677 --> 01:11:22.701
Bye.


01:11:24.013 --> 01:11:25.537
Tell me what you know.


01:11:25.648 --> 01:11:29.516
You know what?
I'll tell you what I do know.


01:11:29.618 --> 01:11:34.487
I know that you, you're feeling me,
but you won't let yourself go there


01:11:34.590 --> 01:11:38.219
because you care more about what
people think than your own happiness.


01:11:38.327 --> 01:11:39.316
Am I right?


01:11:39.428 --> 01:11:42.056
We could both act like, you know,
the other night never happened.


01:11:42.164 --> 01:11:44.098
- But we both know it did.
- I was drunk.


01:11:44.199 --> 01:11:45.632
- No, no.
- No, I was drunk.


01:11:45.734 --> 01:11:49.727
You was being yourself and like my
mama used to say, God rest her soul,


01:11:49.838 --> 01:11:52.136
"A drunk man never tells no tales."


01:11:53.642 --> 01:11:54.700
What?


01:11:56.145 --> 01:11:57.442
- Touché.
- Yeah.


01:11:59.248 --> 01:12:01.842
- So your mom passed?
- Yeah.


01:12:02.751 --> 01:12:05.447
- My mom passed.
- I'm sorry to hear that.


01:12:08.390 --> 01:12:10.153
- What about your dad?
- Who?


01:12:10.259 --> 01:12:13.524
- Your dad?
- My dad, I don't know my dad.


01:12:13.629 --> 01:12:17.463
I got a whole bunch of brothers and
sisters that I don't know, but that's cool.


01:12:19.268 --> 01:12:21.634
It's funny how life works out.


01:12:21.737 --> 01:12:25.798
You never knew your dad,
but my dad would have killed for a boy.


01:12:25.908 --> 01:12:27.239
- For a boy?
- For a boy.


01:12:27.343 --> 01:12:29.436
- Didn't get one.
- I know the feeling.


01:12:30.446 --> 01:12:33.006
That man pushed me so hard, God.


01:12:36.118 --> 01:12:39.610
I made partner in the firm before I was 28.


01:12:39.722 --> 01:12:42.156
My parents have retired to South Beach.


01:12:44.326 --> 01:12:46.191
I don't know, Ms. Julia. You know what?


01:12:46.295 --> 01:12:49.594
You and I,
we come from two different worlds but...


01:12:50.265 --> 01:12:52.495
Well, there is something
going on here, right?


01:13:00.242 --> 01:13:01.675
- You want me to stop?
- No.


01:13:01.777 --> 01:13:03.039
- No?
- No.


01:13:10.152 --> 01:13:14.248
- Oh, you're on time today.
- Well, he's on time all right.


01:13:14.356 --> 01:13:15.687
Oh, my God!


01:13:18.394 --> 01:13:22.626
- What happened to you?
- Some thugs tried to break in here.


01:13:23.599 --> 01:13:26.932
I fought them out.
Before that happened one of them cut me.


01:13:27.035 --> 01:13:28.696
- Are you all right?
- Yeah, yeah, I'm all right.


01:13:28.804 --> 01:13:30.203
Did you catch them?


01:13:30.305 --> 01:13:34.071
No, it was just some crackhead
trying to get some stuff.


01:13:35.444 --> 01:13:39.210
Yeah, I'm getting too old for this, man.
I'm tired of it.


01:13:39.314 --> 01:13:40.576
They win!


01:13:42.484 --> 01:13:44.611
You know, I was thinking.


01:13:46.955 --> 01:13:50.914
I gotta get rid of this place.
I gotta leave this neighborhood.


01:13:51.960 --> 01:13:55.623
So if you can get together what you can
for a down payment,


01:13:55.731 --> 01:13:59.258
and then you hit me up once a month


01:13:59.368 --> 01:14:01.768
until we reach 10, plus interest


01:14:03.338 --> 01:14:06.239
you can have this place.
Would you do that?


01:14:06.341 --> 01:14:09.742
I mean, sure. What are you saying?
Are you serious, man?


01:14:09.845 --> 01:14:13.474
Yeah, this place is officially yours.


01:14:15.317 --> 01:14:18.252
- I mean, I didn't want it like this.
- Me, neither.


01:14:21.390 --> 01:14:25.486
But you gotta let me come back
and help you from time to time.


01:14:25.594 --> 01:14:27.619
Any time you're ready, man.


01:14:29.932 --> 01:14:31.160
All right.


01:14:31.266 --> 01:14:32.756
Oh, man.


01:14:41.043 --> 01:14:42.670
Congratulations.


01:14:45.013 --> 01:14:48.414
- Is he gonna be all right?
- He'll be fine.


01:14:52.421 --> 01:14:53.854
You see that?


01:14:57.793 --> 01:14:59.158
I see it. Oh, look at that.


01:14:59.261 --> 01:15:02.560
- Can you see it, Ms. Julia?
- I do. Wow.


01:15:04.666 --> 01:15:07.635
So, you know, I'm mad excited.


01:15:08.203 --> 01:15:10.137
I'm gonna get my sign for my new garage.


01:15:10.239 --> 01:15:11.467
- I know.
- I know.


01:15:11.573 --> 01:15:14.872
- Sounds great.
- I know. I'm really excited about that.


01:15:15.911 --> 01:15:17.242
Congratulations.


01:15:18.547 --> 01:15:20.606
- Julia?
- Hey.


01:15:20.716 --> 01:15:23.048
Hey. What are you doing here?


01:15:24.653 --> 01:15:27.087
- Nothing, we were just...
- I'm Monty.


01:15:27.890 --> 01:15:30.484
- I remember you.
- Okay.


01:15:30.592 --> 01:15:34.323
- Can I talk to you for a sec?
- Yeah.


01:15:35.797 --> 01:15:38.891
- What are you doing with this man?
- What? We're just hanging out.


01:15:39.001 --> 01:15:41.868
Are you serious? You like him?


01:15:41.970 --> 01:15:45.701
- He's a nice guy.
- Snap out of it, Julia.


01:15:45.807 --> 01:15:49.072
You are a partner at your firm,
the only black woman at that level.


01:15:49.177 --> 01:15:51.270
What do you think your partners
would think if they knew


01:15:51.380 --> 01:15:53.780
you were sleeping around with the help?


01:15:53.882 --> 01:15:56.248
Are you trying to ruin your life?


01:15:57.686 --> 01:15:59.711
- Hey, Julia, how you doing?
- Good, how you doing?


01:15:59.821 --> 01:16:01.948
- Hey, baby, you ready?
- Yeah.


01:16:10.866 --> 01:16:12.356
Come on, guys.


01:16:25.647 --> 01:16:30.311
I think there'll be some people
who are disappointed in me behind this.


01:16:33.789 --> 01:16:36.849
I mean, you know who I am.
I'm from the streets.


01:16:37.993 --> 01:16:40.689
- I can't change that.
- I'm not trying to change you.


01:16:40.796 --> 01:16:42.559
- Do I embarrass you?
- No!


01:16:42.664 --> 01:16:45.497
I mean, it's obvious that I do.
And that's okay. That's okay.


01:16:45.601 --> 01:16:47.762
You just gotta tell me that.


01:16:49.171 --> 01:16:51.662
Tell me the truth,
so that way I know how to deal with it.


01:16:51.773 --> 01:16:54.742
Look, I don't know how I feel. Okay?


01:16:54.843 --> 01:16:56.470
But I can't sit here and lie to you,


01:16:56.578 --> 01:17:00.571
and say that I don't think about
who you are and what you have.


01:17:00.682 --> 01:17:01.979
I do.


01:17:02.084 --> 01:17:04.211
You have three daughters,


01:17:04.319 --> 01:17:06.685
one of whom is almost as big as I am.


01:17:08.090 --> 01:17:12.254
This is new for me, Monty,
and it's different, and I'm trying.


01:17:12.861 --> 01:17:16.024
I am trying
and you gotta give me credit for that.


01:17:20.769 --> 01:17:23.636
Can we finish this conversation? Come on.


01:17:24.239 --> 01:17:27.140
- No.
- No? What are you... What...


01:17:27.242 --> 01:17:29.107
I got my girls for like two more hours,


01:17:29.211 --> 01:17:31.645
and I'm not gonna waste my time
dealing with this.


01:17:31.747 --> 01:17:33.942
But I will tell you something.


01:17:35.717 --> 01:17:38.049
You don't have three girls in your life.


01:17:38.153 --> 01:17:40.519
- It's just you.
- Monty. Monty.


01:17:41.123 --> 01:17:43.182
- Monty.
- Big guy, ain't he?


01:17:43.725 --> 01:17:45.454
- He's so pretty.
- Pretty?


01:17:49.064 --> 01:17:52.363
- Look at that one.
- That one's bigger than all of them.


01:17:53.301 --> 01:17:54.563
Yeah.


01:18:07.916 --> 01:18:10.976
I told him,
"Do not bring this chick to my house."


01:18:16.958 --> 01:18:19.586
- Watch the seatbelt. Come on.
- I love you, Daddy.


01:18:22.864 --> 01:18:25.094
- See you later.
- Come on, y'all. Hurry up.


01:18:25.200 --> 01:18:27.930
- Bye, Ms. Julia.
- All right.


01:18:32.340 --> 01:18:36.436
I love y'all. Okay? Y'all be good, okay?


01:18:36.545 --> 01:18:39.207
- Little butterfly. Go ahead.
- Come on, y'all.


01:18:44.986 --> 01:18:46.112
Come on, y'all. Hurry up.


01:18:46.221 --> 01:18:48.849
Shoot, I've been standing out here
all night. I'm tired, too.


01:18:48.957 --> 01:18:51.551
Y'all think y'all the only ones tired? Shoot.


01:18:58.066 --> 01:19:01.558
Just let me explain, Monty.


01:19:06.708 --> 01:19:11.168
The last man that I loved,
he hurt me to my soul.


01:19:13.048 --> 01:19:15.107
We were together six years,


01:19:17.119 --> 01:19:20.384
and he told me it was over
two days before his wedding.


01:19:21.490 --> 01:19:24.459
I trusted him with everything.


01:19:25.727 --> 01:19:31.427
And I've never felt so low
and stupid and humiliated in my life.


01:19:32.167 --> 01:19:36.797
And so I told myself
not to think about you.


01:19:38.774 --> 01:19:41.470
But I couldn't 'cause I do all the time.


01:19:44.079 --> 01:19:45.706
So what are you saying?


01:19:45.814 --> 01:19:49.477
I'm saying that I've been running
from something that already happened.


01:19:49.584 --> 01:19:52.644
And I'm saying that
I fell in love with you, Monty James.


01:19:52.754 --> 01:19:55.245
And I'm saying
that I hope I'm not in this alone.


01:19:55.357 --> 01:19:56.688
You're not.


01:19:57.325 --> 01:19:58.952
You're not alone.


01:20:03.131 --> 01:20:04.428
Come here.


01:20:13.475 --> 01:20:14.999
Your Honor,
the children's own grandmother,


01:20:15.110 --> 01:20:18.307
their maternal grandmother at that,
went down to Child Welfare


01:20:18.413 --> 01:20:19.710
and prepared a written statement


01:20:19.815 --> 01:20:21.976
as to why the children
should be placed with their father.


01:20:22.083 --> 01:20:23.948
Let me see that.


01:20:24.052 --> 01:20:26.418
- Did you know about this?
- Look, I don't know nothing about this.


01:20:26.521 --> 01:20:28.216
I don't know
what they're trying to pull now.


01:20:28.323 --> 01:20:31.292
Your Honor, my client has the means
to take care of these girls.


01:20:31.393 --> 01:20:32.621
And she wants to take care...


01:20:32.727 --> 01:20:35.594
It says here that her mother thought
the means were ill-gotten.


01:20:35.697 --> 01:20:38.666
- Well, that's pure...
- What do you do for a living, Ms. Jackson?


01:20:38.767 --> 01:20:42.498
Well, I don't work, Your Honor,
but my boyfriend does.


01:20:42.604 --> 01:20:43.798
What does he do?


01:20:43.905 --> 01:20:46.396
You know, I mean,
he owns his own businesses.


01:20:46.508 --> 01:20:48.408
And where are the tax returns?


01:20:48.510 --> 01:20:50.205
Well, you know,
we was working on getting them.


01:20:50.312 --> 01:20:52.803
And you know what, Your Honor,
you keep asking me about my stuff,


01:20:52.914 --> 01:20:55.144
you need to be asking Monty
about some of his secrets


01:20:55.250 --> 01:20:56.512
'cause he got a whole lot of them.


01:20:56.618 --> 01:20:58.245
What is she talking about?


01:20:58.353 --> 01:21:03.916
Your Honor, Mr. James was convicted of the
rape of a 16-year-old girl 16 years ago.


01:21:04.025 --> 01:21:06.357
And we're afraid
for the safety of the children.


01:21:06.461 --> 01:21:09.294
Counselor,
what do you have to say about this?


01:21:11.233 --> 01:21:13.224
I wasn't aware, Your Honor.


01:21:13.335 --> 01:21:16.566
It's right here in black and white.
Yeah, he was sentenced to eight years.


01:21:16.671 --> 01:21:19.606
He's been on probation
ever since his release.


01:21:19.708 --> 01:21:21.573
I'll take this matter under advisement.


01:21:21.676 --> 01:21:24.406
I need to review
the circumstances of this case.


01:21:24.512 --> 01:21:25.809
Adjourned.


01:21:29.517 --> 01:21:33.920
So how long has he been screwing you?
Huh? 'Cause I know he can't afford you.


01:21:34.589 --> 01:21:36.716
- Move, move.
- Hey. Hey, hey, hey, hey.


01:21:36.825 --> 01:21:38.554
I'll have to tap that ass.


01:21:38.660 --> 01:21:40.457
Let me explain. Let me explain something.


01:21:40.562 --> 01:21:41.790
- Get away from me.
- Hold on.


01:21:41.897 --> 01:21:43.296
- Let me...
- Get you hands off of me.


01:21:43.398 --> 01:21:44.888
- Wait, let me explain.
- You know what, shut up.


01:21:45.000 --> 01:21:47.969
Shut the hell up. I can't even
stand to look at you, right now.


01:21:48.069 --> 01:21:51.163
I asked you if there were any surprises.
You said no.


01:21:51.273 --> 01:21:52.331
You're a rapist.


01:21:52.440 --> 01:21:54.465
You don't think that's something
that I should have known about?


01:21:54.576 --> 01:21:56.407
- Let me explain.
- Don't you touch me.


01:21:56.544 --> 01:21:58.512
Julia, look. Look. Look.


01:21:58.613 --> 01:22:01.776
Let me ask you a question. Did you
or did you not go to jail for rape?


01:22:01.883 --> 01:22:04.010
- Julia, look. Julia, look.
- Did you go to jail?


01:22:04.119 --> 01:22:06.053
- Did you go to jail for rape, Monty?
- Yes.


01:22:06.187 --> 01:22:07.245
That's all I need to know.


01:22:07.355 --> 01:22:10.153
Do you know what, it doesn't even matter
'cause you're a liar, Monty.


01:22:10.258 --> 01:22:13.785
You're a filthy... God, you're a filthy liar.


01:22:13.895 --> 01:22:18.594
This case is over. Maya will call you and
tell you when to return for the ruling.


01:22:18.700 --> 01:22:22.602
You don't need me anymore, Monty,
and I certainly don't need you.


01:22:32.614 --> 01:22:34.673
So, you like him that much?


01:22:35.784 --> 01:22:38.218
- I fell in love with him.
- Oh, Julia.


01:22:39.354 --> 01:22:43.256
Sweetie, this was supposed to be
a fun thing, not a love thing.


01:22:43.792 --> 01:22:44.952
I know.


01:22:46.328 --> 01:22:48.193
Go ahead, Bren, tell me, "I told you so."


01:22:48.296 --> 01:22:51.663
Oh, girl, you know I'm not gonna do that.


01:22:51.766 --> 01:22:54.496
It's just good that you found out now.


01:22:54.602 --> 01:22:56.467
I'm with Brenda on this.


01:22:57.305 --> 01:23:00.399
Julia, this guy was probably
just after your money.


01:23:00.508 --> 01:23:02.703
He wasn't even like that.


01:23:02.811 --> 01:23:07.874
You know, you guys, he was a hard worker.
And he treated...


01:23:07.983 --> 01:23:10.884
God, he treats those girls
like they are princesses.


01:23:10.986 --> 01:23:13.614
Well, let's not forget he has a record.


01:23:15.190 --> 01:23:17.249
How did I not know he was lying?


01:23:17.359 --> 01:23:21.352
Because he's probably really good at it.
They all are.


01:23:23.832 --> 01:23:29.498
It's like I'm hearing it, you guys,
and I'm trying to understand, but I just...


01:23:29.604 --> 01:23:31.765
It doesn't make sense.


01:23:33.141 --> 01:23:34.403
You know?


01:23:35.543 --> 01:23:39.172
And I can't make my brain believe
that it was all a lie.


01:23:44.552 --> 01:23:46.543
Is it as bad as it sounds?


01:23:48.123 --> 01:23:51.615
Honey, it's as bad as it sounds.


01:23:53.294 --> 01:23:57.025
Jules, just do yourself a favor.


01:23:57.132 --> 01:23:59.464
Forget about this guy.


01:23:59.567 --> 01:24:02.161
He just sounds like a lot of trouble.


01:24:04.773 --> 01:24:05.831
Okay?


01:24:32.133 --> 01:24:33.828
I just want to say...


01:24:52.487 --> 01:24:53.852
It was like that.


01:24:55.557 --> 01:24:58.185
<i>Hi, this is Julia. Leave a message.</i>


01:25:06.668 --> 01:25:08.033
Who that?


01:25:21.049 --> 01:25:22.914
What y'all doing here?


01:25:23.918 --> 01:25:25.510
What y'all doing here?


01:25:26.855 --> 01:25:28.516
Where your mama at?


01:25:29.557 --> 01:25:31.923
What happened, Sisi? What happened?


01:25:33.528 --> 01:25:36.588
Daddy, we don't really care
what the judge says.


01:25:37.565 --> 01:25:39.658
We just want to be with you.


01:25:39.801 --> 01:25:41.234
I'm staying here.


01:25:43.505 --> 01:25:45.496
- How did y'all get here?
- We walked.


01:25:45.607 --> 01:25:47.507
Y'all walked at 3:00 in the morning?


01:25:47.609 --> 01:25:50.339
We can't stay there anymore, Daddy.
I'm sorry.


01:25:50.445 --> 01:25:52.572
- What you talking about?
- Daddy.


01:25:52.680 --> 01:25:54.978
- What happened?
- Joe...


01:25:55.783 --> 01:25:59.810
Joe what? Sisi you can talk to me.
You tell me, what happened?


01:26:00.989 --> 01:26:03.048
- Joe keeps...
- He keeps what?


01:26:03.825 --> 01:26:05.816
Joe keeps hitting China.


01:26:05.927 --> 01:26:07.019
What?


01:26:08.897 --> 01:26:10.455
- Where? Come here. Where?
- On my back.


01:26:10.565 --> 01:26:12.032
On your back?


01:26:13.134 --> 01:26:16.433
Mama was sitting right there.
She didn't even say anything.


01:26:20.708 --> 01:26:24.508
Hold on. Hold on a second.
Come here. He hit you?


01:26:24.612 --> 01:26:27.342
He hit me because I wouldn't stop crying.


01:26:27.448 --> 01:26:30.212
- Daddy, I was so sad.
- Okay.


01:26:30.318 --> 01:26:32.684
Okay, come here. Come here.


01:26:36.157 --> 01:26:38.921
Grandma told me.
Grandma told me to look after y'all.


01:26:39.027 --> 01:26:41.621
I got to look after y'all.


01:26:41.729 --> 01:26:43.993
So y'all gonna stay with me now.


01:26:48.403 --> 01:26:50.803
Y'all gonna stay with me now. Okay?


01:26:50.905 --> 01:26:52.270
Okay?


01:26:52.373 --> 01:26:55.672
Sisi, I'm so sorry. I am so sorry.


01:27:00.415 --> 01:27:04.010
Okay, you gotta stay with me.
It's gonna be all right.


01:27:09.257 --> 01:27:10.588
It's gonna be all right.


01:28:38.413 --> 01:28:40.313
Wait, hold up.


01:28:40.415 --> 01:28:43.851
Monty, Monty. Man, come on.


01:28:43.951 --> 01:28:45.851
<i>Some girls up in here, man.</i>


01:28:45.953 --> 01:28:48.581
Monty, what are you doing, man?


01:28:48.690 --> 01:28:51.090
Come on. What's taking you so long?


01:28:51.192 --> 01:28:53.422
- I'm Monty.
- We know who you are.


01:28:53.528 --> 01:28:54.756
You beat our team.


01:28:54.862 --> 01:28:56.022
- How old are you?
- Eighteen.


01:28:56.130 --> 01:28:57.825
You know, this sure is a nice place
you have here.


01:28:57.932 --> 01:28:59.194
You want to see my room?


01:28:59.300 --> 01:29:00.892
- So you gonna call me?
- Probably not.


01:29:01.002 --> 01:29:03.232
You're just like all the other guys.


01:29:03.338 --> 01:29:05.067
Mandy, what are you doing?
Did he force you?


01:29:05.173 --> 01:29:06.868
- No way. Tell him.
- Mandy.


01:29:08.309 --> 01:29:09.537
- Yes, Daddy.
- What?


01:29:09.644 --> 01:29:11.202
- Sir, I didn't do anything.
- Shut up.


01:29:11.312 --> 01:29:13.940
- I didn't do anything. It was her idea.
- Shut up, superstar.


01:29:14.048 --> 01:29:15.811
- Tell him, I didn't do anything.
- Call the police.


01:29:15.917 --> 01:29:18.317
Tell him, Amanda.
If you don't tell the truth, I'm going to jail.


01:29:18.419 --> 01:29:20.182
- Tell him the truth.
- You're ball days are over.


01:29:20.288 --> 01:29:21.778
- You got me?
- I didn't do nothing.


01:29:21.889 --> 01:29:23.857
<i>- Shut up!
- I didn't do nothing.</i>


01:29:23.958 --> 01:29:25.289
<i>- Shut up!
- I didn't do...</i>


01:29:25.393 --> 01:29:27.691
<i>Get you hands off of me.
I can't even stand to look at you.</i>


01:29:27.795 --> 01:29:29.524
<i>You're a rapist.</i>


01:29:52.453 --> 01:29:54.717
I bet you
he won't ever take our money again.


01:29:54.822 --> 01:29:58.690
I know, that's right.
Got to keep it straight, Jen.


01:29:58.793 --> 01:30:00.988
You know I got your back, right, baby?


01:30:01.095 --> 01:30:03.290
That's why you my girl.


01:30:03.398 --> 01:30:06.367
You know, I want to go see that movie
with the dude with the ax.


01:30:06.467 --> 01:30:08.059
No, no, no, it's the chain saw.


01:30:08.169 --> 01:30:10.660
Baby, you know
if we went to see that movie...


01:30:23.117 --> 01:30:24.584
Check it out.


01:30:25.086 --> 01:30:27.384
Oh, snap. Load up. Load up.


01:31:32.086 --> 01:31:33.280
Stop it!


01:32:02.984 --> 01:32:05.179
<i>There was a near riot today
in the Edgewood community.</i>


01:32:05.286 --> 01:32:07.846
<i>Police officers were called in
to break up a fight</i>


01:32:07.955 --> 01:32:11.652
<i>between local gang members
and residents who had had enough.</i>


01:32:11.759 --> 01:32:14.387
<i>Among those arrested was Monty James.</i>


01:32:14.495 --> 01:32:17.521
<i>You may remember Monty James,
a high school basketball star,</i>


01:32:17.632 --> 01:32:20.396
<i>who was falsely convicted in 1990</i>


01:32:20.501 --> 01:32:24.494
<i>for allegedly having non-consensual sex
with a 17-year-old girl.</i>


01:32:25.206 --> 01:32:27.800
I'm assuming you have
admissible evidence this time.


01:32:27.909 --> 01:32:29.035
Yes, Your Honor.


01:32:29.143 --> 01:32:31.703
The police seized
several pounds of marijuana,


01:32:31.812 --> 01:32:33.404
hidden in the defendant's vehicle.


01:32:33.514 --> 01:32:34.811
Subsequent search of the residence


01:32:34.916 --> 01:32:37.817
turned up several kilograms
of crack cocaine.


01:32:37.919 --> 01:32:39.750
This time, Your Honor,
we have a valid warrant.


01:32:39.854 --> 01:32:42.914
Your Honor, even though
they served a search warrant,


01:32:43.024 --> 01:32:45.185
they still have no witnesses.


01:32:49.130 --> 01:32:51.826
Your Honor, I'll testify.


01:33:15.056 --> 01:33:18.548
Congratulations,
it looks like you have a case.


01:33:18.659 --> 01:33:22.652
Take them into custody.
There will be no bond.


01:33:22.763 --> 01:33:24.492
- Next case.
- Wait, get your hands off of me.


01:33:24.599 --> 01:33:27.466
The State of Georgia versus Monty James.


01:33:30.371 --> 01:33:35.434
Order. Order in this court! All of
you, quiet, or I'll have you removed.


01:33:35.810 --> 01:33:37.869
I will have order.


01:33:40.214 --> 01:33:41.738
Order.


01:33:41.849 --> 01:33:43.339
Order.


01:33:43.451 --> 01:33:45.146
I said order!


01:33:46.387 --> 01:33:49.413
- Who's here for the defense?
- I am, Your Honor.


01:33:50.358 --> 01:33:51.985
Ms. Rossmore.


01:33:52.093 --> 01:33:54.493
May I take a second, please?


01:33:54.595 --> 01:33:56.290
What you doing here?


01:33:56.397 --> 01:33:58.695
I'm sorry, I didn't give
you a chance to explain,


01:33:58.799 --> 01:34:02.565
and if you don't ever want to speak
to me again, I completely understand.


01:34:02.670 --> 01:34:04.228
Let me help you.


01:34:05.239 --> 01:34:06.672
Monty, just let me help you.


01:34:06.774 --> 01:34:08.765
Just get me back to my kids.


01:34:10.411 --> 01:34:11.969
Ms. Rossmore?


01:34:13.814 --> 01:34:17.045
Your Honor, there's no evidence
my client committed any criminal act.


01:34:17.151 --> 01:34:19.016
The State has no case against him.


01:34:19.120 --> 01:34:20.451
We demand a preliminary hearing


01:34:20.554 --> 01:34:22.488
and request the State be required
to show probable cause.


01:34:22.590 --> 01:34:25.559
Your Honor, I'm sure that one of these
witnesses can attest to the fact


01:34:25.660 --> 01:34:28.993
that Mr. James drove his vehicle
into the previous defendant's vehicle.


01:34:29.096 --> 01:34:30.495
It was an accident.


01:34:30.598 --> 01:34:33.692
I'm sure that the subsequent fistfight
was an accident also there, Counselor.


01:34:33.801 --> 01:34:34.995
Where are the witnesses?


01:34:35.102 --> 01:34:37.002
Your Honor,
the entire neighborhood saw this.


01:34:37.104 --> 01:34:38.298
I'm sure we have a witness.


01:34:38.406 --> 01:34:41.807
May I have one of the witnesses
please stand at this time?


01:34:54.021 --> 01:34:56.353
- Your Honor...
- I'm dismissing the case.


01:35:12.606 --> 01:35:13.937
I love you,


01:35:16.277 --> 01:35:18.438
and I'm sorry for everything.


01:35:46.340 --> 01:35:49.935
Oh, man. Come on, man.
I can't believe this.


01:35:51.178 --> 01:35:53.203
The whole neighborhood remembered.


01:35:53.314 --> 01:35:54.508
- Daddy!
- Daddy!


01:36:15.569 --> 01:36:17.059
Come here, baby.


01:36:22.710 --> 01:36:26.168
- It's all on you now, boy.
- I love you, man. I appreciate it.


01:36:26.280 --> 01:36:27.542
Bye, babies.

